meaning:
Destroy Lonely refers to Wafi Lalani, the owner of Atlanta’s Jewelry Unlimited. Wafi himself had, at the point of the song’s creation, previously worked with all of the members of Destroy Lonely’s label, Opium, on pieces of custom jewelry.

Notably, the first higher quality snippet of this song would be previewed via @jewelryunlimited on Instagram, the sound overlaying a video exhibiting Destroy Lonely’s newest chain. The post’s description would state:

@destroylonely – the original nocturnal🦇 cross – crafted in white and black handset diamonds with a VVS infinity link. Enjoy the unreleased snippet and call up Wafi when u need some exclusive diamonds
